- linear rigid-plate/equal-stiffness bolt-group reference distribution with force/moment equilibrium residuals;
- detailed thread/bearing-friction reference model with exact NASA-based relation, explicit friction/radius, legacy linearized comparator, CLI and analytical fixtures.

